# Freehold Shoal's squatters' shelter cave (CIPlay freehold_shoal_caves, 11-11; any world). Points as in its recipe (the
# origin frame): the mouth at 40 6 on the open north-east sand, facing the landing; a short way in north to the room
# (its middle about 40 30) on the cave tool's own mound; the squatters' tin chest at 40 30. Dry, no air zone.
island Freehold Shoal keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

picture fh_cave_out 40 6 -8 40 4 8
walk 40 0 to 40 6 to 40 16 to 40 27
picture fh_cave_in 40 4.5 18 40 3.5 30 light=20
open Squatters' tin chest
wait 2
expect item Plastic 2
walk 40 27 to 40 16 to 40 6 to 40 0
